    /// - `"bun:test"`
    /// - `"vitest"`
    /// - Deno assertion module URL
    ///
    /// Check the [testing library](https://testing-library.com/docs/) you are using, and the article that inspired this rule.
    ///
    /// ## Examples
    ///
    /// ### Invalid
    ///
    /// ```js,expect_diagnostic
